{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56321","headline":"渔父歌沧浪赋附歌 一 · 何蠲","name":"渔父歌沧浪赋附歌 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微风动兮百花坞，扣舷归兮满江南。\n挂云帆兮何足数，来濯缨兮沧浪浦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何蠲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}